  "name": "vundle",
  "description": "Vundle is a modular plugin management system for the Vim editor that automates runtime path orchestration and script lifecycle operations. It enables declarative dependency specification directly within the configuration file, facilitating streamlined installation, update, and cleanup processes via Git integration. The project implements a robust autoloading architecture to manage external scripts while maintaining minimal impact on editor startup performance.",
